    "description": "The Insurance Claims Appeal API provides a mechanism for users to retrieve a list of insurance claims that are under appeal. This API is essential for insurance professionals and claims adjusters who need to monitor the status and details of ongoing claims disputes. By enabling users to access relevant information, it assists in the decision-making process regarding claim resolutions. Typical consumers include insurance company employees and service providers involved in the appeals process, ensuring transparency and efficiency in claim management.",
